{"id":"632785","name":"煎鸡胸肉拌黄瓜","author":"不做妖精好多年","authorId":"1806550","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/632785/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"黄瓜","amount":"半根"},{"name":"鸡胸肉","amount":"80g"}],"sub":[{"name":"木耳","amount":"小许"},{"name":"食用油","amount":"半匙"},{"name":"红椒","amount":"半个"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"处理好的木耳切块。","img":"images/632785/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"黄瓜打一下外皮，要外皮处理不干净的样子，切块。","img":"images/632785/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"切红椒，所有食材放一起。","img":"images/632785/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"把鸡胸肉整齐的部分切片。","img":"images/632785/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"放碗里放食盐。","img":"images/632785/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"放生抽。","img":"images/632785/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"抓匀腌制10分钟。","img":"images/632785/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"放淀粉抓匀。","img":"images/632785/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"热锅冷油。","img":"images/632785/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"油热放鸡肉。","img":"images/632785/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"两面煎金黄色。","img":"images/632785/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"蛹铲子分成小块，放锅边沥油。","img":"images/632785/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"大蒜处理干净放食盐和鸡精。","img":"images/632785/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"捣成蒜泥放白醋。","img":"images/632785/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"拌匀。","img":"images/632785/step_15.jpg"},{"step":16,"desc":"把鸡肉放黄瓜里，放蒜泥。","img":"images/632785/step_16.jpg"},{"step":17,"desc":"拌匀即可。","img":"images/632785/step_17.jpg"},{"step":18,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/632785/step_18.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：不粘锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}